--- task
id: t39
dataset: section8
kind: annotations on a declaration

--- intent
Write a stored query returning the names of people older than `$cutoff`, with the description "People over a given age" and the instruction "Pass the age as an integer".

--- params
{"cutoff": 60}

--- edition2
query people_over($cutoff: I32) @description("People over a given age") @instruction("Pass the age as an integer") {
  match { $p: Person  $p.age > $cutoff }
  return { $p.name }
}

--- edition3
query people_over($cutoff: I32) @description("People over a given age") @instruction("Pass the age as an integer") {
  match { $p: Person  $p.age > $cutoff }
  return { $p.name }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["p.name"]
["Bob"]
["Frank"]
